      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The test verifies that after explicitly closing a `SequenceReader`, all subsequent reads return EOF even though \"Bar\" is still unread. I'll improve understandability by: removing unused imports, renaming helpers to be more intent-revealing, using the `EOF` constant instead of `-1`, and adding brief comments that explain the *why*.The improved test compiles successfully."
